msgstr "App store"

#: live/usr/sbin/lazaro-flatpak
msgid "Abrir la tienda"
msgstr "Open the store"

#: live/usr/sbin/lazaro-flatpak
msgid ""
"Flatpak y Flathub ya están activos en este equipo.\n"
"\n"
"Las aplicaciones de Flathub se buscan e instalan desde la tienda de aplicaciones."
msgstr ""
"Flatpak and Flathub are already active on this computer.\n"
"\n"
"Flathub apps are searched for and installed from the app store."

#: live/usr/sbin/lazaro-flatpak live/usr/share/lazaro/bienvenida/funciones/22-flatpak.conf
msgid "Activar"
msgstr "Turn on"

#: live/usr/sbin/lazaro-flatpak
msgid ""
"Flathub es una colección de aplicaciones que no vienen en Alpine, como OnlyOffice, Chrome, Brave, Spotify o Zoom. Flatpak es el sistema que las instala.\n"
"\n"
"Al activarlos, esas aplicaciones aparecen en la tienda de aplicaciones. Necesita internet y descarga unos 20 MB; cada aplicación de Flathub ocupa bastante más que una de Alpine.\n"
"\n"
"¿Activar Flatpak y Flathub?"
msgstr ""
"Flathub is a collection of apps that do not come with Alpine, such as OnlyOffice, Chrome, Brave, Spotify or Zoom. Flatpak is the system that installs them.\n"
"\n"
"Once they are turned on, those apps show up in the app store. It needs internet and downloads about 20 MB; each Flathub app takes up quite a lot more space than an Alpine one.\n"
"\n"
"Turn on Flatpak and Flathub?"

#: live/usr/sbin/lazaro-flatpak
msgid "Activando Flatpak y Flathub…"
msgstr "Turning on Flatpak and Flathub…"

#: live/usr/sbin/lazaro-flatpak
msgid "Listo. Cierra la sesión y vuelve a entrar para que la tienda de aplicaciones muestre lo de Flathub."
msgstr "Done. Log out and back in so the app store shows the Flathub apps."

#: live/usr/sbin/lazaro-flatpak
